## 📌 Problem Context

In San Miguel de Tucumán, most accounting firms and SMEs process their documentation **100% manually**: they receive receipts and invoices via WhatsApp or email, classify them into folders, copy data to Excel, and generate reports by hand.

**Real Cost of the Problem:**
- ⏱️ 3 daily hours of repetitive manual work
- ❌ Frequent transcription errors
- 📉 Zero real-time visibility into the business
- 🔁 No scalability as the client base grows

---

## 💡 Implemented Solution

An **end-to-end** automation pipeline powered by generative AI that transforms document chaos into actionable business intelligence, requiring no human intervention in the operational workflow.

