## 🚀 How to Use This Template

### Prerequisites
- n8n account (cloud or self-hosted)
- [Groq](https://console.groq.com) API Key *(free)*
- Telegram Bot via [@BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather)
- Google Account with Sheets enabled

### Setup
```bash
# 1. Import workflow_template.json into n8n
# 2. Configure credentials in n8n Settings
# 3. Activate workflows
# 4. Send the first message to the Telegram bot

    ⚠️ The workflow_template.json file includes the complete structure with placeholders for credentials. Replace YOUR_API_KEY with actual values before running.

